# .assetsignore — the boundary between the working tree and the public web.
#
# `wrangler pages deploy .` uploads the WHOLE repo directory, so anything not
# listed here is downloadable from martechsignal.com. Verified 2026-09-13:
#   * .gitignore is NOT honoured by the deploy. Proof: /__pycache__/gsc_inspect.cpython-313.pyc
#     was publicly served and byte-identical to the local file, even though
#     __pycache__/ is in .gitignore.
#   * .assetsignore IS honoured (wrangler reads it from the deploy directory and
#     feeds the patterns to a gitignore-style matcher).
#
# Before this file existed, the following were all live and public: all 31
# content drafts, tools/*.py, tools/*.json, deploy.sh, gsc_inspect.py, docs/*.md,
# .github/workflows/ci.yml, __pycache__/*.pyc and 15 *.bak-* editor backups.
#
# Whatever you add here, verify it with (must print 404):
#   curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://martechsignal.com/deploy.sh
# ...and re-check that the real pages still work (must print 200):
#   curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://martechsignal.com/tools/nocobase/

# ── build + deploy machinery ──────────────────────────────────────────────
/deploy.sh
/gsc_inspect.py
/*.py
/README.md
/.gitignore
/.github/
/.hermes/
/__pycache__/
/.pytest_cache/
/.wrangler/

# ── source content: unpublished drafts must never be public ──────────────
/content/

# ── repo tests (dev-only, same reasoning as the pipeline scripts) ────────
/tests/

# ── pipeline source + state ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: the generated tool pages (/tools/<slug>/, /tools/index.html) and the
# 132 tool HTML files under tools/ ARE public and must stay that way - only the
# machinery beside them is excluded.
/tools/*.py
/tools/*.json
/tools/*.md
/tools/.indexnow-key
/tools/__pycache__/

# ── working inputs and internal docs ─────────────────────────────────────
/data/
/docs/

# ── dead editor backups ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak-*
*.bak
